 c and you need to save it\, then answer all questions and then submit it b
 ack to me completed as a TYPED assignment and NOT hand written or taking a
  picture of it. This is the start of using more electronic submissions tha
 t you will need to do in both university and also possible future jobs. Re
 member\, looking for details in your responses. Not just ONE WORD response
 s. Think and elaborate on you responses. Remember PROPER SIGNATURES The du
 e date for this is Friday Sept 25th. Thanks and if you have any questions 
 please ask. Mr. D Submit
